@start docs/soft-delete.md
# Soft delete

Rows are never removed. `deleted` is null while the row is live and
holds a timestamp once it is gone.

Every read has to say so. Before:

    const records = await this.prisma.order.findMany({
      where: { customerId },
    });

After:

    const records = await this.prisma.order.findMany({
      where: { customerId, deleted: null },
    });

This page is the migration note for SOFT-12. The "before" block is what
the code looked like and is not something to go and fix.

@start prisma/schema.prisma
model Order {
  id         String    @id
  customerId String
  reference  String
  deleted    DateTime?
}

model Customer {
  id      String    @id
  email   String
  active  Boolean   @default(true)
  deleted DateTime?
}
